 "6x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+6\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "5023efbc4a5ac1d8d85aa770504141b2f6adffb0be8461a7c7b6183c8600186b" "basis" 1141 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-14453" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "x\\operatorname{cos}⁡6x+x\\operatorname{sin}⁡6x+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "5023efbc4a5ac1d8d85aa770504141b2f6adffb0be8461a7c7b6183c8600186b" "basis" 1141 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-14453" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "x\\operatorname{cos}⁡6x-x\\operatorname{sin}⁡6x+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "5023efbc4a5ac1d8d85aa770504141b2f6adffb0be8461a7c7b6183c8600186b" "basis" 1141 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-14453" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "6x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+6\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "5023efbc4a5ac1d8d85aa770504141b2f6adffb0be8461a7c7b6183c8600186b" "basis" 1141 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49660" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate ${\\int }_{-2}^{0}x{e}^{-x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "5023efbc4a5ac1d8d85aa770504141b2f6adffb0be8461a7c7b6183c8600186b" "basis" 1141 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49660" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x & ⇒ & {u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{-x} & ⇒ & v=-{e}^{-x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int x\\cdot {e}^{-x}\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\cdot (-{e}^{-x})-\\int (-{e}^{-x})\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-2}^{0}x{e}^{-x}\\,\\text{d}x & =-x{e}^{-x}{|}_{-2}^{0}+{\\int }_{-2}^{0}{e}^{-x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-x{e}^{-x}{|}_{-2}^{0}-{e}^{-x}{|}_{-2}^{0} \\\\  & =[-0{e}^{-0}-2{e}^{2}]-[{e}^{0}-{e}^{2}] \\\\  & =-2{e}^{2}-1+{e}^{2} \\\\  & =-1-{e}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "5023efbc4a5ac1d8d85aa770504141b2f6adffb0be8461a7c7b6183c8600186b" "basis" 1141 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49660" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2405a0d59b762ca246d05602433b2bd1e5d035f108323f2b9b81df964df831d5" "basis" 1141 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49660" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "5023efbc4a5ac1d8d85aa770504141b2f6adffb0be8461a7c7b6183c8600186b" "basis" 1141 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49660" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "-1+{e}^{2}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "5023efbc4a5ac1d8d85aa770504141b2f6adffb0be8461a7c7b6183c8600186b" "basis" 1141 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49660" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "-1-{e}^{2}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "5023efbc4a5ac1d8d85aa770504141b2f6adffb0be8461a7c7b6183c8600186b" "basis" 1141 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49660" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "-2-{e}^{2}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "5023efbc4a5ac1d8d85aa770504141b2f6adffb0be8461a7c7b6183c8600186b" "basis" 1141 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49660" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "1+{e}^{2}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "5023efbc4a5ac1d8d85aa770504141b2f6adffb0be8461a7c7b6183c8600186b" "basis" 1141 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49660" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "1-3{e}^{2}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "5023efbc4a5ac1d8d85aa770504141b2f6adffb0be8461a7c7b6183c8600186b" "basis" 1141 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114309" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int (x+4)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "5018c91201e1bff8d42af9bd410b499f0a7ab693d9aeb8d3c0c9f2d1dbc19bf6" "basis" 1264 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114309" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int (x+4)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x+4\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\, & ⟹\\,v=-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (x+4)\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x & =(x+4)\\cdot (-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{2})-\\int (-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{2})\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (x+4)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\text{d}x & =-\\frac{(x+4)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{(x+4)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{2}+\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)}{4}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "5018c91201e1bff8d42af9bd410b499f0a7ab693d9aeb8d3c0c9f2d1dbc19bf6" "basis" 1264 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114309" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "1a77b5d0d3582ab92a8158644acff6d27ec0cbf8ee8f7abf77b21d7ef73cdffb" "basis" 1264 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114309" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "5018c91201e1bff8d42af9bd410b499f0a7ab693d9aeb8d3c0c9f2d1dbc19bf6" "basis" 1264 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114309" "f